                      "name": "t:names.product_description",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Mojo silk boxers were built from the feedback of over <strong>50,000 men</strong>. We rethought the classic boxer from scratch to deliver the comfort, performance and confidence real men asked for.</p><p>The <strong>fitted trunk legs</strong> hug the thigh to stop chafing and ride-up. The redesigned <strong>contour pouch</strong>, with its double front seam, gives more room, better support and a subtle enhancement to your profile. It's engineered not just for comfort, but for appeal.</p><p>Crafted from <strong>100% mulberry silk</strong>, Mojo is <strong>up to 89% more durable</strong> than ordinary boxers, yet softer, more breathable and better at regulating temperature. It keeps your crown jewels cooler, fresher and hormonally balanced all day long. Silk is natural, not plastic, so nothing synthetic sits against the area that matters most.</p><p>And yes, the design was tested with real women, who called it <strong>“the sexiest fit on a man”</strong> they've seen. This isn't just underwear. It's your new daily standard.</p>",
