          "settings": {
            "title": "ultra soft, I need 20 more pairs!",
            "text": "The silk is so soft I no longer get that irritating rubbing from other pairs that cost me twice as much. Plus they stay fresh all day, even after weeks of washing. 10/10 for comfort and durability!",
            "name": "Samuel P.",
