        "review_2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "title": "no sweat or smell, this really works!",
            "text": "After a full day at work, there's no sweat and no smell. I feel fresh from morning till night. Best pair I've ever owned, and I wish I'd bought them years ago. I'm ordering five more pairs next month.",
            "name": "Ron D.",
            "date": ""
          }
        },
        "review_3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Husband Approves, and so do I ;)",
            "text": "We'd been trying for a baby for over a year. I read the Harvard study on boxers and swapped his whole drawer for Mojo. He loves how soft they are, even after loads of washes. The best part? We're expecting in March!",
            "name": "Carole J.",
            "date": ""
          }
        },
        "review_4": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "title": "wife approves, and I love them",
            "text": "My wife binned my entire underwear drawer and bought the 8-pack. I was annoyed for about five minutes. The breathability is exceptional, I feel fresh whatever I'm doing, and yes, she approves.",
            "name": "Alex N.",
            "date": ""
          }
        },
        "review_5": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "title": "I'm a big guy, and these stay put!",
            "text": "I'm a big guy, and these fit great. No riding up, they stay in place. They feel amazing and there's no chafing, even on heavy workdays. My second set, and the first still looks and feels the same after six months. All my old boxers are going in the bin.",
            "name": "John M.",
            "date": ""
          }
        },
        "review_6": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "title": "all day comfort and no moisture",
            "text": "Natural soft feel and excellent at wicking moisture. My son showed me the burn test: polyester melts into a plastic bead, silk turns to ash. I know which one I want against my skin. The most comfortable pair I've ever worn.",
