      "blocks": {
        "item_1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is mulberry silk and why is it used for boxer shorts?",
            "answer": "<p>Mulberry silk is the finest natural fibre, loved for its softness, breathability and gentle feel. We use it in Mojo for premium comfort, better intimate hygiene and a smooth fit that never traps heat.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Why do dermatologists recommend silk boxers?",
            "answer": "<p>Dermatologists recommend silk because it is smooth, hypoallergenic and cuts unpleasant friction, keeping intimate areas comfortable, fresh and irritation-free. Unlike polyester, it's natural, with nothing synthetic against your skin.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does the breathability of silk boxers differ from other materials?",
            "answer": "<p>Silk's weave lets air circulate and moves moisture away, reducing humidity and sweat. Cotton soaks it up and holds it, polyester traps it. You stay cool, dry and fresh whatever you're doing.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What does the “buy 2 + get 3 free” offer mean?",
            "answer": "<p>Buy 2 pairs and get 3 more free: five pairs for £49.95, just £9.99 each. It's our limited Black Friday offer, a perfect chance to replace your whole drawer. Spend over £40 and shipping is free. Not to be missed!</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does the durability of silk boxers compare to traditional boxers?",
            "answer": "<p>Mojo boxers are built for durability. They resist wear better than regular boxers, come with a 180 Wash Guarantee and last up to 3x longer. A hole within 6 months? We replace them free.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_6": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are silk boxers suitable for sensitive skin?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. 100% mulberry silk is hypoallergenic and soft, so it suits sensitive skin and reduces irritation. Its smooth fibres cut friction, helping you stay comfortable and fresh all day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_7": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I wash silk boxers in the washing machine?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, Mojo boxers are machine-washable. Wash at 30°C and they keep their shape and softness for 180 washes.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
